{
  "name": "39 · Stock Alert (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 39 · Stock Alert\nEvery morning it checks your **Stock** sheet. Anything at or below its reorder level → one clear WhatsApp to the owner (out-of-stock first). Each item alerts once a day, not every hour.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Stock**: SKU, Item, In stock, Reorder level, Unit, Vendor, Last alert.\n2. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n3. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nKeep **In stock** updated from your billing software or by hand.",
        "height": 595,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "4f47a797-043e-4885-8596-ef730a6280ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 10,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4355fef1-b371-4f2a-ade3-1c8411040c82",
      "name": "Daily 10 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Stock"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c78cbc5b-3bad-41d0-bb48-730832e7140a",
      "name": "Stock",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Stock tab: SKU, Item, In stock, Reorder level, Unit, Vendor, Last alert (yyyy-mm-dd)\nconst num = v => Number(String(v ?? '').replace(/[^0-9.-]/g, '')) || 0;\nconst today = $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd');\nconst low = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.SKU && num(r['In stock']) <= num(r['Reorder level']) && r['Last alert'] !== today)\n  .map(r => ({ SKU: r.SKU, Item: r.Item, left: num(r['In stock']), reorder: num(r['Reorder level']), unit: r.Unit || 'pcs', vendor: r.Vendor || '-' }));\nreturn low.length ? [{ json: { count: low.length, items: low } }] : [];"
      },
      "id": "4b69346e-8cff-40e2-b6f1-cf0c710f9ea9",
      "name": "Below reorder level",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short WhatsApp stock alert for the owner of YOUR BUSINESS NAME. Items at or below reorder level: {{ JSON.stringify($json.items) }}\nFormat: '📦 Low stock: {{ $json.count }} item(s)' then one line per item: item, how many left vs reorder level, vendor. Items with 0 left go first, marked 🔴. End with 'Reply PO to auto-draft purchase orders (agent 40).' Use only these numbers. Output only the message.",
        "hasOutputParser": false
      },
      "id": "19bc99d9-035b-4426-9fd4-5ba54ab749b8",
      "name": "AI writes stock alert",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "603e309f-f53b-47d0-b661-420210b02b49",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
